100 million euros.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/27/nokia-nok-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q1","e":"nok","d":"2018-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Moving on to our cost savings program, we remain on target to deliver the 1.2 billion euros of recurring annual cost savings in the full year 2018 with 800 million euros expected to come from operating expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/27/nokia-nok-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q1","e":"nok","d":"2018-04-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"We reiterated our guidance for recurring net sales to grow at a 10% CAGR over the three-year period ending 2020 and continue to expect to reach operating margins of 85% for the full year 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/27/nokia-nok-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2018-07-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"And I think on your-- the kind of the trade war-related question, I think we are not seeing direct impact as we speak, but, of course, the overall uncertainty that increases as a result of this situation is, of course, impacting economic activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/26/nokia-nok-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2018-07-26","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Stefan Slowinski","x":"And, I guess, along the same lines, in the recently announced $200 billion of U.S. tariffs, have you had a look at that and how to think about how that may or may not affect Nokia going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/26/nokia-nok-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2018-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajeev Suri","x":"We remain on track to achieve our targeted EUR 1.2 billion of recurring annual cost savings in full-year 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/26/nokia-nok-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2018-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Within this, Nokia had approximately EUR 130 million of restructuring and associated cash outflows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/26/nokia-nok-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2018-07-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rajeev Suri","x":"We have reiterated our guidance for 2018 and still expect to deliver within the 6% to 9% guidance range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/26/nokia-nok-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2018-07-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Also, as Rajeev mentioned earlier, we also reiterated our guidance for Networks operating margin for the full-year 2018 to be in the 6% to 9% range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/26/nokia-nok-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2018-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Then I will touch briefly on the US-China tariffs and their impact on our overall business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/nokia-corporation-nok-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2018-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Then turning briefly to the US-China tariffs, our team has been working diligently to assess the impacts of these tariffs, but -- that these tariffs will have on our overall business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/nokia-corporation-nok-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2018-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajeev Suri","x":"Earlier this year, when we first shared our 2020 guidance, I noted that we saw the opportunity to further reduce costs even after the end of this year when we expect to successfully deliver on our 1.2 billion euros cost savings plan related to our Alcatel-Lucent acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/nokia-corporation-nok-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2018-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajeev Suri","x":"We have now quantified those future actions and are targeting EUR700 million in annual cost savings by the end of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/nokia-corporation-nok-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2018-10-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"It is important to note that we have today reiterated our guidance for recurring net sales within Nokia Technologies to grow at a three-year CAGR of 10% through 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/nokia-corporation-nok-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2018-10-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Looking at our guidance for Networks operating margin, while we do see some risk, we continue to expect a strong fourth quarter, and thus we today reiterated our guidance for Networks operating margin to be in the 6% to 9% range in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/25/nokia-corporation-nok-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q4","e":"nok","d":"2019-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Excluding restructuring, we generated an increase in net cash related to networking capital of approximately EUR 540 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/nokia-nok-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2018 Q4","e":"nok","d":"2019-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kristian Pullola","x":"Restructuring amounted to approximately EUR 140 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/nokia-nok-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2019 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajeev Suri","x":"The main area of disappointment in the quarter was our cash position, although our performance was not totally unexpected given the large outflows for shareholder dividends, incentive payments and restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/nokia-corporation-nok-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2019 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajeev Suri","x":"Other examples include Sempra Renewables, which is using our technology to connect wind farms and target a 90% cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/nokia-corporation-nok-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2019 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rajeev Suri","x":"As you will have seen today, we have maintained our guidance for a full year non-IFRS operating margin of 9% to 12%, non-IFRS diluted earnings per share of EUR 0.25 to EUR 0.29 and for slightly positive free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/nokia-corporation-nok-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2019 Q2","e":"nok","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Achal Sultania","x":"That said, we have maintained our outlook assumption for cash taxes and as we expect this impact to normalize in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/nokia-corporation-nok-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NOK 2019 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2019-10-24"