ith regards to cost saving program, we're on track to achieve that isle EUR 500 million target by the end of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/nokia-nok-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOK 2020 Q3","e":"nok","d":"2020-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Marco Wiren","x":"As a result, we have reduced our 2020 outlook assumptions by EUR 50 million for capex, as well as cash taxes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/nokia-nok-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOK 2020 Q4","e":"nok","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pekka Lundmark","x":"5G gross margin was up due to product cost reduction, partly helped by higher ReefShark volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/nokia-nok-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOK 2021 Q1","e":"nok","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marco Wiren","x":"In Q1 cash flow, strong profits, and networking capital were partially offset by capex and restructuring cash outflows, and these are relating to our previous cost-saving programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/nokia-nok-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOK 2021 Q1","e":"nok","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marco Wiren","x":"In addition to our efforts to streamline and simplify the report, you may have noticed that we are now providing some information about the addressable markets' development on my MI, MN, NI, and CNS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/nokia-nok-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOK 2021 Q1","e":"nok","d":"2021-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Pekka Lundmark","x":"At this point, we are maintaining our outlook for the full year as we want to see how 2021 continues to develop.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/nokia-nok-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"